OL,3,GNEWSA'Inquisitive' puppy trains as
OL,4,ALondon fire dog
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive-month-old puppy Chase has joined
OL,7,Fthe London Fire Brigade's (LFB) fire
OL,8,Finvestigation team.
OL,10,FThe cocker spaniel follows recently
OL,11,Fretired Sherlock and joins Smokey and
OL,12,FSimba, two other fire investigation
OL,13,Fsearch dogs with the brigade.
OL,15,FAt the end of his training, Chase and
OL,16,Fhis handler, sub officer Peter Guppey,
OL,17,Fwill be assessed on their ability to
OL,18,Fwork effectively as a team, search a
OL,19,Frange of environments and locate traces
OL,20,Fof ignitable substances.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
