OL,3,GNEWSA'Inquisitive' puppy trains as
OL,4,ALondon fire dog
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuppey said Chase had a lot to learn in
OL,7,Fthe coming months, and described him as
OL,8,Fa "great little character". He added:
OL,9,F"He's enthusiastic, inquisitive and
OL,10,Falways keen to get involved, so I'm
OL,11,Freally enjoying getting to know him."
